    "The200mm dimension is clear provisional equipment height, not whole-mower height. Original lowest modeled wheel point is about129.245mm below frame top; add the box base elevation plus200mm before any roof skin or extra mounting thickness.",
    "AABB screening is followed by exact solid intersections where needed; nearest clearances use OCCT BRepExtrema_DistShapeShape against unchanged original mechanical bodies.",
    "Rectangular volume does not establish full inventory fit. Driver fins, electrical clearances, connectors, wire bends, cooling, antenna sky view, battery, service access, tray/mounts and structural load paths remain unmodelled.",
